			(property "Description" "PIC32MK motor control family MCU (the GPK parts have no CAN FD; DS60001519E Table 1/2), MIPS32 microAptiv + FPU, 120 MHz, 1 MB flash, 256 KB RAM, 4x CAN FD, USB FS OTG, 3x CDAC, 4 op amps, TQFP-64 10x10mm. Pin names from DS60001519E Table 4 (same pinout as the 64-pin GPK; CVDn, PWM, FLT and PMP aliases omitted). RPxx pins are PPS-remappable."
